#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "312_Hana"
msgid "Chief, I couldn't help but overhear... Are you really going\\r\nto lend money to that piece of work? He's nowhere near\\r\nfit to start a company."
msgstr "Jefe, no pude evitar escuchar, pero... ¿En serio piensa\\r\nprestarle dinero a ese tipo? No está ni remotamente\\r\ncalificado para iniciar una empresa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "324_Akiyama"
msgid "You think so, too, huh? To tell you the truth, I agree. He's\\r\nall talk. You see a lot of that nowadays."
msgstr "¿También piensas eso? A decir verdad, coincido contigo.\\r\nEs pura palabrería, últimamente hay muchos tipos así."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "336_Hana"
msgid "So you never planned on giving him a loan in the first\\r\nplace? Then why bother with a test?"
msgstr "¿Así que nunca tuvo la intención de darle un préstamo?\\r\n¿Entonces por qué se molestó en darle una prueba?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "348_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, I'll lend him the money. But only if he passes. I'm\\r\ngoing to teach him it's a rough world out there."
msgstr "Oh, le prestaré el dinero. Pero solo si pasa la prueba\\r\nTengo que enseñarle que la vida es dura."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=pre_context
#. y4:msg_label=Contexto previo
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hana
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "360_Hana"
msgid "But what if... I mean, just on the off chance..."
msgstr "Pero ¿y si... en el hipotético caso de que...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Akiyama"
msgid "Don't worry about it. A big-mouth like him could never hope\\r\nto pass one of my tests."
msgstr "No te preocupes. Un fanfarrón como él nunca podría pasar\\r\nuna de mis pruebas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Akiyama"
msgid "Find three people to be your business partners and bring\\r\nthem to me."
msgstr "Busca a tres personas que quieran ser tus socios comerciales\\r\ny tráelos conmigo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_Shiobara"
msgid "Business partners? Three of them? Is that really all you\\r\nneed?"
msgstr "¿Tres socios comerciales? ¿Eso es todo lo que necesita?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah. People who'd be happy to help build up a company.\\r\nWhat do you think? Can you do it?"
msgstr "Sí. Personas que estén dispuestas a ayudarte a levantar\\r\nuna empresa. ¿Qué dices? ¿Puedes hacerlo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Shiobara"
msgid "What are you talking about? I've got tons of friends. It\\r\nwon't take long at all!"
msgstr "¿Estás bromeando? Tengo muchísimos amigos.\\r\n¡Será pan comido!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_Talk_OK"
msgid "I'll be right back, okay? Better get that five million ready\\r\nfor me!"
msgstr "Regreso enseguida. ¡Será mejor que tenga esos\\r\ncinco millones listos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "492_Akiyama"
msgid "Bring me the business cards of ten company presidents. Any\\r\nkind of company will do."
msgstr "Consígueme las tarjetas de presentación de diez presidentes\\r\nde cualquier empresa. Cualquier tipo de empresa vale."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Bring me ten presidents' business cards.
msgctxt "504_Shiobara"
msgid "Ten business cards? Is that really all you need?"
msgstr "¿Diez tarjetas de presentación? ¿Solo eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_Akiyama"
msgid "Corporate CEOs, presidents of small factories－take your\\r\npick. Just find ten of them, get their cards, and bring them\\r\nhere."
msgstr "Grandes CEOs, presidentes de pequeños emprendimientos,\\r\nlo que sea. Encuentra a diez, consigue sus tarjetas y\\r\ntráemelas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "528_Shiobara"
msgid "Are you sure? That sounds pretty easy. I mean, I used to be\\r\na president myself. I can get twenty or even thirty cards,\\r\nno problem."
msgstr "¿Está seguro? Eso parece bastante sencillo. Yo mismo fui\\r\ndirector al fin y al cabo. Puedo conseguir veinte o incluso\\r\ntreinta tarjetas, sin problema."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540_Akiyama"
msgid "Excellent, I'm glad to hear it. Well, good luck. I'll see\\r\nyou soon."
msgstr "Excelente, me alegra oírlo. Buena suerte. Nos vemos\\r\npronto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "552_Shiobara"
msgid "I'll be right back, okay? Better get that five million ready\\r\nfor me!"
msgstr "Regreso enseguida. ¡Será mejor que tenga esos\\r\ncinco millones listos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "612_Akiyama"
msgid "Invite a hostess out after the club closes and bring her\\r\nback here to my office."
msgstr "Invita a una hostess a salir cuando su club cierre y luego\\r\ntráela aquí a mi oficina."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "624_Shiobara"
msgid "A hostess club? That's it? I just bring the girl here and\\r\nthe five million's mine?"
msgstr "¿De un cabaret club? ¿Nada más? ¿Basta con traer a la\\r\nchica a este lugar y los cinco millones son míos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=31
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P31
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "636_Shiobara"
msgid "I don't know..."
msgstr "No lo sé..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "648_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, come on. It should be a piece of cake for a guy like\\r\nyou! What's the problem?"
msgstr "¡Oh, vamos! Debería ser pan comido para un tipo como tú.\\r\n¿Cuál es el problema?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "660_Shiobara"
msgid "I just don't have the cash. Hostess clubs are expensive, you\\r\nknow? It's a real shame..."
msgstr "Verá yo... no tengo dinero.\\r\nY esos clubes son carísimos, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "672_Talk_Smile"
msgid "I'd have all kinds of girls trailing after me if I just had\\r\nthe money. I'd be like the Pied Piper of Kamurocho!"
msgstr "Si tuviera el dinero, tendría a todas las chicas detrás de\\r\nmí. ¡Sería el Don Juan de Kamurocho!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "684_Akiyama"
msgid "I guess I'll have to point you over to my friend's hostess\\r\nclub, then. You can put it on my tab."
msgstr "Supongo que no hay de otra. Te mandaré al cabaret club\\r\nde un amigo. Puedes poner todo en mi cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=36
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P36
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "696_F_oba_sitchr"
msgid "The place is called Sweet, over on Pink Street. Just tell them Akiyama sent you and they'll take care of the rest."
msgstr "El lugar se llama Sweet, y está en la calle Pink. Diles que Akiyama te envió y ellos se encargarán del resto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=37
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P37
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "708_Shiobara"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "720_Akiyama"
msgid "You can't do it without money, right? Well, I'm making that\\r\nparticular problem go away. So what do you think? Can you\\r\ndo that?"
msgstr "No puedes hacer nada sin dinero, ¿no? Bueno, me encargaré\\r\nde que eso no sea un problema. ¿Qué dices? ¿Crees poder\\r\nhacerlo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "732_Shiobara"
msgid "Yes, of course! No problem at all. I'll bring you the best\\r\nhostess in the club!"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! ¡Iré ahora mismo!\\r\n¡Le traeré a la hostess número uno!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "744_F_oba_sitchr"
msgid "I'll be right back, okay? Better get that five million ready\\r\nfor me!"
msgstr "Regreso enseguida. ¡Será mejor que tenga esos\\r\ncinco millones listos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "816_Hana"
msgid "Chief, why are you giving him a second chance? You'd usually\\r\nsend somebody like him well on his way by now."
msgstr "Jefe, ¿por qué le da una segunda oportunidad? Normalmente\\r\nya habría echado a la calle a alguien como él."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "828_Akiyama"
msgid "He's just so astoundingly clueless. Don't you want to see\\r\nhow it all ends?"
msgstr "Encuentro fascinante lo ingenuo que es ¿No tienes\\r\ncuriosidad por ver cómo acaba todo esto?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=48
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P48
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hana
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "840_Hana"
msgid "Not particularly. Look at it from my perspective:"
msgstr "La verdad es que no. Póngase en mi lugar:"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "852_F_oba_sitchr"
msgid "You always forget to collect on your loans. Too many\\r\nboneheaded customers like him and I'll be up to my neck in\\r\nextra work!"
msgstr "Siempre se le olvida cobrar los préstamos. ¡Con tantos\\r\nclientes cabeza hueca como él, voy a terminar inundada\\r\nde trabajo extra!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "864_Akiyama"
msgid "And I appreciate every last ounce of work you do, Hana-chan.\\r\nDon't I always treat you to a delicious meal at the end of\\r\nevery month?"
msgstr "Claro, claro. Y estoy muy agradecido por todo tu trabajo, Hana-chan. Por eso siempre te invito a comer algo muy\nrico al final de cada mes, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "876_Hana"
msgid "...I guess you can do what you want. It is your company\\r\nafter all."
msgstr "Jo... Supongo que puede hacer lo que quiera, después\\r\nde todo es su empresa..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "924_Hana"
msgid "Chief... enough's enough. I've never seen you give anybody\\r\nthis many chances."
msgstr "Jefe... ¿no cree que ya fue suficiente? Nunca le vi darle\\r\ntantas oportunidades a alguien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "936_Akiyama"
msgid "I suppose you're right... But it's all just so interesting,\\r\ndon't you think? Guy's a walking disaster."
msgstr "Supongo que tienes razón... Pero esto está de lo más\\r\ninteresante. El tipo es un desastre con patas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=57
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P57
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hana
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "948_Hana"
msgid "Chief..."
msgstr "Jefe..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "960_Akiyama"
msgid "You know, Hana-chan, a man might have lots of people he\\r\ncalls \"friend,\" but I doubt many of them would actually be\\r\nwilling to risk their livelihoods on him."
msgstr "Verás, Hana-chan. Un hombre puede tener a muchas\\r\npersonas a las que llama \"amigos\", pero no muchas\\r\nestarían dispuestas a arriesgarlo todo por él."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "972_Talk_No"
msgid "He says it'll be a cinch to find three of them, but unless\\r\nhe's especially trustworthy or charismatic, they won't be on board."
msgstr "Dice que será pan comido encontrar a tres, pero a menos\\r\nque sea especialmente confiable o carismático, nadie le ayudará."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=66
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P66
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1056_Shiobara"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=67
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P67
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1068_Akiyama"
msgid "Welcome back. So, where're those three partners?"
msgstr "Hey, bienvenido de vuelta. Y bien, ¿dónde están tus tres socios?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1080_Shiobara"
msgid "They just don't understand! I told them they could easily\\r\npull in a hundred million a year if they just left everything to me."
msgstr "¡Son unos tontos! Les dije que podrían ganar cien millones al año\\r\ntranquilamente si me dejaban manejar todo, y no me hicieron caso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=69
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P69
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1092_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah... So you've failed the test."
msgstr "Ah... Entonces has fallado la prueba."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1104_Shiobara"
msgid "It's not my fault－it's theirs! They're just too blind to see it. And after all those times they begged for an invite to my parties, too!"
msgstr "¡Pero no fue mi culpa! Ellos son los tontos que no pueden ver el potencial. ¡Y pensar que siempre me suplicaban que los invitara a mis grupitos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=71
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P71
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1116_Akiyama"
msgid "Parties?"
msgstr "¿Grupitos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1128_Shiobara"
msgid "My online-game parties. You mean you haven't heard? They're\\r\nkind of a big deal. They call me \"Hurricane Salt.\""
msgstr "Mis grupos para juegos en línea. ¿Acaso vive bajo una roca?\\r\nSoy toda una celebridad en ese mundillo.\nMe conocen como \"Huracán Salado\"."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1140_Akiyama"
msgid "I see... Well, it hardly matters at this point. You weren't\\r\nable to pass the test, which means our loan discussion is\\r\nover. My apologies."
msgstr "Ya veo... Bueno, eso no importa ahora. No has logrado\\r\nsuperar la prueba, por lo tanto debes olvidarte del préstamo.\\r\nMis disculpas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=75
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P75
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hana
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1164_Hana"
msgid "Of course! Right this way, sir."
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! Por aquí, señor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1176_Shiobara"
msgid "Wait just a second! You're telling me you know all about\\r\nme from one lousy test? Who do you think you are, a god?"
msgstr "¡Espera...! ¿Acaso está insinuando que una simple prueba\\r\nes suficiente para juzgar mis habilidades?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1188_Hana"
msgid "Please! I'm counting on you! Give me just one more chance!\\r\nOne more!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, dame otra oportunidad!\\r\n¡Una chiquitita! ¡Solo una vez más, ándale!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=66
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P66
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1200_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1212_Shiobara"
msgid "Please! I'm begging you! Let me try again! I swear I'll take\\r\nit a whole lot more seriously this time!"
msgstr "¡Se lo imploro! ¡Déjeme intentarlo de nuevo! ¡Le juro que\\r\nme lo tomaré en serio esta vez!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1224_Akiyama"
msgid "We have other business to attend to, you know. But it\\r\ndoesn't look like you'll be leaving anytime soon, so... All\\r\nright, one more time."
msgstr "Normalmente no perderíamos el tiempo con esto, pero\\r\nbueno, te veo muy insistente así que... Te daré otra\\r\noportunidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1236_Akiyama"
msgid "If it were you, Hana-chan, how would you go about\\r\ncollecting ten presidents' cards?"
msgstr "Hana-chan, si estuvieras en su lugar, ¿cómo conseguirías\\r\nesas diez tarjetas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1248_Hana"
msgid "Hmm... Well, I'd probably pop into an office building and\\r\ntalk to company presidents directly."
msgstr "Mmm... Iría directamente a las oficinas de la empresa y\\r\nhablaría directamente con el presidente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1260_Akiyama"
msgid "A frontal attack, huh? Good answer. As for me, I'd probably\\r\ngrab hold of a president or two, take them to a print shop,\\r\nand have them make me some cards."
msgstr "Bien, bien. Esa es una manera correcta de hacer las cosas.\\r\nYo en cambio llevaría a un director a una imprenta y le\\r\nconvencería \"amablemente\" de hacerle unas tarjetas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1272_Hana"
msgid "A little aggressive, maybe, but, yeah, that sounds like\\r\nsomething you'd do."
msgstr "Bastante agresivo... Pero suena a algo que usted haría."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1284_Akiyama"
msgid "Nothing wrong with that. Hell, I could even have a print\\r\nshop make up a bunch of fake cards if I wanted."
msgstr "Así me parece bien. Además, ¿para qué buscar a un\\r\npresidente? Podría hacer todas las tarjetas falsas\\r\nque quisiera en la imprenta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1296_F_oba_sitchr"
msgid "Your straightforward method requires courage, while my way\\r\ncalls for quick wit."
msgstr "La manera de hacer las cosas de Hana-chan es valiente,\\r\nen cambio la mía es astuta. Cualquiera es válida."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=87
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P87
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1308_F_oba_sitchr"
msgid "Regardless, I doubt he's capable of either."
msgstr "De todos modos, dudo que el tipo pueda hacer alguna."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=66
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P66
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1380_Shiobara"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=94
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P94
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1392_Akiyama"
msgid "Welcome back. So, you got those cards?"
msgstr "Hey, bienvenido de vuelta. ¿Conseguiste las tarjetas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1404_Shiobara"
msgid "I only have one, my father's. None of the CEOs I knew at my\\r\ncompany are even in this town..."
msgstr "Solo una, la de mi padre. Los contactos que tenía en mi\\r\nantigua empresa ni siquiera están en la ciudad..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1416_F_oba_sitchr"
msgid "Are there <Italic>any</Italic> company presidents here? It's all businessmen\\r\nand restaurateurs."
msgstr "¿Es que no hay <Italic>ni un</Italic> solo jefe de verdad en este lugar?\\r\nTodo está lleno de asalariados o negocios nocturnos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1428_Akiyama"
msgid "Actually, you're looking at one. Sorry if my appearance\\r\ndeceived you."
msgstr "De hecho, estás hablando con uno. Disculpa si mi\\r\naspecto no es el del típico jefe de empresa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1440_Hana"
msgid "Well, then, since you weren't able to pass the test, I'm\\r\nafraid I won't be giving you the loan after all."
msgstr "Lamento decirle que, al no haber superado la prueba,\\r\nno puedo darle el préstamo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=75
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P75
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hana
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1464_Hana"
msgid "Of course! Right this way, sir."
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! Por aquí, señor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1476_Shiobara"
msgid "Wait just a second! That test was set up all wrong! I can\\r\ndo better, I promise!"
msgstr "¡Espere un segundo! ¡Esa prueba estaba mal hecha!\\r\n¡Puedo hacerlo mejor, de verdad! ¡Se lo juro!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1488_P_aki_stand"
msgid "Please! I'm counting on you! Give me just one more chance!\\r\nOne more!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, dame otra oportunidad!\\r\n¡Una chiquitita! ¡Solo una vez más, ándale!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=1
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 1
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=103
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P103
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_decision_group=1
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Find three business partners. -> T1.P10 | 2. Bring me ten presidents' business cards. -> T1.P19 | 3. Invite a hostess here after the club closes. -> T1.P29
msgctxt "1500_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, all right, but only one more. Now, then..."
msgstr "Bueno, está bien, pero solo una más. Veamos..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1512_Hana"
msgid "But why'd you send him to a hostess club? He'll just go out\\r\nand have fun－and on your tab, no less."
msgstr "¿Por qué lo envió a un club de hostess? Lo único que\\r\nhará en ese lugar, será derrochar dinero y encima suyo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1524_Akiyama"
msgid "A first-time visitor to a hostess club hardly ever manages\\r\nto invite a girl out afterward."
msgstr "En un club de hostess, los primerizos como él no tienen\\r\nninguna posibilidad de conseguir una cita con una chica."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1536_P_aki_stand"
msgid "Anybody who succeeds is either rich or a smooth talker.\\r\nBut this guy's broke, so..."
msgstr "Solo los ricachones o los donjuanes consiguen algo en esos\\r\nsitios. Y este tipo era un pobretón, así que..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=107
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P107
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hana
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1548_Hana"
msgid "So he has about a zero percent chance of pulling this off."
msgstr "Su posibilidad de lograrlo es nula."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1560_Akiyama"
msgid "We don't know that. I mean, he might fall into some crazy\\r\nbeginner's luck."
msgstr "Nunca se sabe. Quizás tiene un golpe de suerte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=109
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P109
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hana
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1572_Hana"
msgid "That would be a miracle."
msgstr "Eso sería un milagro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1584_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, if he pulls off a miracle at a time like this, it'll be\\r\nthe first of many. Luck is just another kind of talent,\\r\nwouldn't you agree?"
msgstr "Bueno, si consigue un milagro en un momento como este,\\r\nten por seguro que será el primero de muchos. ¿Acaso la\\r\nsuerte no es una habilidad en sí misma?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1596_Hana"
msgid "Maybe, but even so... If that guy gets his very own miracle,\\r\nthen he's one of the most talented men I've ever met."
msgstr "Puede ser, pero... si a ese tipo le llegase a pasar ese milagro,\\r\nentonces dejaré de creer en todo Dios existente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=66
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P66
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1668_Shiobara"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=118
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P118
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1680_Akiyama"
msgid "Welcome back. So, where's that hostess?"
msgstr "Hey, bienvenido de vuelta.\nEntonces... ¿dónde está la hostess?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1692_Shiobara"
msgid "Aw, that club is no good. The girl at my table only said\\r\na few words then clammed up almost immediately."
msgstr "Agh, ese club es un desastre. A la chica de mi mesa parecía\\r\nque le habían cosido la boca, habló un poco y luego se\nquedó bien callada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=120
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P120
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1704_F_oba_sitchr"
msgid "Isn't it her job to get the conversation going? I'm the customer. The <Italic>paying</Italic> customer."
msgstr "¿No se supone que su trabajo es mantener la conversación? Soy el cliente, el que <Italic>paga</Italic>."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=121
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P121
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1716_Akiyama"
msgid "Yeah, paying with someone else's money."
msgstr "El que paga con dinero prestado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=122
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P122
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1728_Shiobara"
msgid "Seriously, though, any other club, and I would've had 'em eating out of the palm of my hand! It all boils down to a bad club."
msgstr "Créame, ¡en cualquier otro sitio las tendría a mis pies! ¡Todo es culpa de este club de mala muerte!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1740_Akiyama"
msgid "Even if we were to assume it was the club's fault, you still\\r\ndidn't manage to pass the test. That means I won't be\\r\ngiving you a loan."
msgstr "El club puede tener toda la culpa que quieras, el hecho\\r\nes que no pasaste la prueba. Y por lo tanto, no puedo\\r\ndarte el préstamo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=75
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P75
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hana
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1764_Hana"
msgid "Of course! Right this way, sir."
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! Por aquí, señor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1776_Shiobara"
msgid "Wait just a second! If you'd just let me try a different\\r\ntest, I'm positive I'd pass with flying colors!"
msgstr "¡Espere! ¡Deme otra prueba y le haré cambiar\\r\nde opinión! ¡Se lo suplico!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1788_P_aki_stand"
msgid "Please! I'm counting on you! Give me just one more chance!\\r\nOne more!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, dame otra oportunidad!\\r\n¡Una chiquitita! ¡Solo una vez más, ándale!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=66
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P66
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1800_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=decision
#. y4:msg_label=Pregunta con opciones
#. y4:msg_section=2
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 2
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=129
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P129
#. y4:msg_decision_group=2
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Find three business partners. -> T1.P10 | 2. Bring me ten presidents' business cards. -> T1.P19 | 3. Invite a hostess here after the club closes. -> T1.P29
msgctxt "1812_Talk_Ojigi"
msgid "Fine. But this really and truly is your last chance."
msgstr "Está bien. Pero esta es la última, ¿entendido?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1824_Akiyama"
msgid "It's always \"just one more\" with you... I've given you three\\r\nchances already. No matter how many times you try, you'll\\r\nnever pass."
msgstr "Ya estoy cansado de tus \"una más\"... Te he dado tres\\r\noportunidades y nada. No importa cuántas veces\\r\nlo intentes, nunca lo lograrás."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=66
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P66
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1836_Shiobara"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1848_Akiyama"
msgid "All right? So leave. I'm tired of having to string along a\\r\nbig-talking nitwit."
msgstr "¿Ya entendiste? Ahora puedes irte.\\r\nEstoy cansado de tener que aguantar a un charlatán como tú."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1860_Shiobara"
msgid "Please! This is it. My very last chance. If you give up\\r\non me now, I'm finished!"
msgstr "¡Por favor! ¡Esta es la definitiva! ¡Mi última oportunidad!\\r\n¡Si me abandona ahora, estaré acabado!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=134
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P134
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1872_Akiyama"
msgid "Will you just leave already?"
msgstr "La puerta está por allá."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1884_Shiobara"
msgid "I'm positive I can build a company that will never, ever\\r\nneed to downsize!"
msgstr "¡Estoy seguro de que puedo crear una empresa que\\r\nnunca despedirá a sus empleados!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1896_Akiyama"
msgid "You really want to start your own company, don't you? Are\\r\nyou sure you're being entirely honest with me－and with yourself?"
msgstr "¿Tanto anhelas tener tu propia empresa? ¿Es este tu verdadero\\r\nsueño o estás tratando de hacerme sentir mal?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=137
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P137
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1908_Shiobara"
msgid "Absolutely. No lies and no excuses, period."
msgstr "Lo digo enserio.\nSin mentiras, sin excusas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1920_Akiyama"
msgid "Fine. Then this is your honest-to-goodness last chance. You\\r\nfail, you leave. Got it?"
msgstr "...Está bien. Pero esta es realmente la última oportunidad.\\r\nSi no logras aprobar, tendrás de irte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=139
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P139
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1932_Shiobara"
msgid "Got it. I'll pass it for sure this time. You'll see."
msgstr "Cuente con ello. Esta vez la pasaré seguro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=141
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P141
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1956_Akiyama"
msgid "Okay, here we go..."
msgstr "Bien, entonces como prueba..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1968_Talk_Yes"
msgid "My friend's leaflet company is in the red. If you can get it\\r\nto turn a profit again, I'll lend you the five million yen."
msgstr "La empresa de folletos de mi amigo está pasando por\\r\ndificultades financieras. Si logras revertir la situación y\\r\ngenerar beneficios, te daré los cinco millones de yenes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=143
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P143
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "1980_Shiobara"
msgid "But that could take years!"
msgstr "Pero... ¡eso podría llevar años!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1992_Akiyama"
msgid "The door's right there if you're not interested. What's it\\r\ngoing to be? You in or out?"
msgstr "La puerta está ahí mismo si no te interesa.\\r\n¿Qué piensas hacer? ¿Aceptas o no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=145
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P145
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "2004_Shiobara"
msgid "All right. Where is this leaflet company, anyway?"
msgstr "E-está bien. ¿Dónde se supone que está esa empresa de folletos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2016_Akiyama"
msgid "It's Paradise Advertising on West Shichifuku Street, just\\r\npast the M Store. Let me give them a call."
msgstr "Se llama Publicidad Paradise. Está en la calle Shichifuku\\r\nal oeste, en el quinto piso del edificio donde está el restaurante\nde soba \"Umamoto\". Déjame llamarlos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2064_Akiyama"
msgid "Hello, Paradise Advertising? This is Akiyama over at Sky\\r\nFinance."
msgstr "¿Hola, Publicidad Paradise? Le habla Akiyama, de Sky\\r\nFinance."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=151
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P151
#. y4:msg_speaker=Paradise Advertising President
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=29
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "2076_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "Akiyama-san! To what do I owe the pleasure?"
msgstr "¡Akiyama-san! ¿A qué debo el placer?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2088_Akiyama"
msgid "You'd been asking for management advice, right? I've found\\r\njust the man for the job. Name's Shiobara-kun. I'll be\\r\nsending him your way shortly."
msgstr "Me comentaron que necesitaban ayuda con la gestión, ¿no?\\r\nPues he encontrado a la persona ideal para ayudarlos. Se\\r\nllama Shiobara-kun. Lo enviaré pronto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=153
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P153
#. y4:msg_speaker=Paradise Advertising President
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=29
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "2100_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr "¡¿En serio?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=154
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P154
#. y4:msg_speaker=Paradise Advertising President
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=29
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "2112_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "Shiobara-san, is it? Thank you so much. I'll be waiting."
msgstr "Shiobara-san, ¿verdad? Muchísimas gracias. Le estaré esperando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2172_Akiyama"
msgid "Now it's all up to you. Paradise Advertising is on West\\r\nShichifuku Street. I'm sure you'll see it when you get\\r\nthere."
msgstr "Ahora todo depende de ti. Publicidad Paradise está\\r\nal oeste de la calle Shichifuku. Ya verás que es fácil\\r\nde encontrar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=160
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P160
#. y4:msg_speaker=Shiobara
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=10
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Invite a hostess here after the club closes.
msgctxt "2184_Shiobara"
msgid "All right. I'll be back."
msgstr "Bien. Volveré pronto."

